# Hedera AI Court — Demo Recording
Output demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 960
Set Height 740
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 24
Set PlaybackSpeed 1

# Start with an empty terminal for 1.5s so viewers see the prompt
Sleep 1500ms

# Type the command naturally
Type "npm run dev"
Sleep 400ms
Enter

# Wait for the welcome banner to render
Sleep 3000ms

# Pause so viewers can read the banner
Sleep 2000ms

# Type the dispute word by word for drama
Type "My co-founder wants to pivot 6 months before launch."
Sleep 300ms
Type " I think it's a mistake. Who's right?"
Sleep 1000ms
Enter

# Wait for all 3 Gemini calls + formatting (~8-12s)
Sleep 12000ms

# Pause on the verdict
Sleep 3500ms

# Answer the HITL prompt
Type "yes"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

# Wait for HCS submission (~5s)
Sleep 7000ms

# Pause on the hashscan link so viewers can read it
Sleep 4000ms
